{"page_id": "olmo_table_tests-937a90b27de5c5cf8b06cf47f139c9349e48_pg7-p1", "markdown": "UNIVERSITY OF LIVERPOOL\n\n2. OTHER FEES\n\nWhere students are not paying a consolidated programme fee as prescribed in section 1, fees shall be payable as follows:\n\nRegistration: Go Higher (means tested benefits)\n\nRegistration: Submission Pending\n\nExamination: Higher Doctorate\n\nRe-examination: MD\n\nRe-examination: PhD\n\nRe-examination: MPhil\n\nRe-examination: Dissertation\n\nRe-examination in session: taught programmes\n\nRepeat study: with attendance\n\nRepeat study: with partial remote supervision\n\nRepeat study: without attendance\n\n200 (50 per quarter)\n\n710\n\n485\n\n485\n\n390\n\n185\n\nNil\n\nPro rata to full-time programme fee\n\n1/3 of module credit value\n\n3. RESEARCH SUPPORT FEES\n\nFees payable for consumables for students on MPhil and PhD programmes will be specified within individual applicants' offer letters. Research support fees shall be payable for specified programmes as follows:\n\nDoctor of Dental Science (Orthodontics)\n\nDoctor of Dental Science (Endodontics)\n\nDoctor of Dental Science (Special Care Dentistry)\n\nMRes Biomedical Sciences and Translational Medicine\n\nMRes Clinical Science\n\nDip Bovine Reproduction\n\n(E)\n\n3,854 (14,099 for overseas students)\n\n13,556 (20,940 for overseas students)\n\n3,244 (14,099 for overseas students)\n\n3,000\n\n3,000\n\n1,195\n\n7 | Schedule of Fees 2018/19", "width": 1654, "height": 2339, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "UNIVERSITY OF LIVERPOOL", "bbox": {"x": 681.0588233325069, "y": 102.33124979212747, "width": 394.0411764705883, "height": 107.20416666666681}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2. OTHER FEES", "bbox": {"x": 194.58823503929972, "y": 292.37499996519335, "width": 214.0470588235294, "height": 29.237500000000157}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Where students are not paying a consolidated programme fee as prescribed in section 1, fees shall be payable as follows:", "bbox": {"x": 194.588235031